Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:19.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz wins the Rolex Paris Masters{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯赢得巴黎大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.06,0:00:22.36,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the very first time in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:24.48,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}8{\fs68}日晚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.48,0:00:26.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴黎大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:28.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡第一次在这里夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:30.15,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}可在{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:32.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他还面对两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:39.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}先用两盘击败米克尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:41.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第三轮 贝雷蒂尼赛前退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:44.56,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡直接晋级{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:54.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So Carlos Alcaraz off and running in Paris this year,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯在巴黎取得开门红
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.66,0:01:00.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}six wins in a row now off the back of his title in Vienna.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N延续维也纳夺冠后的连胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.71,0:01:03.91,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}真正的险关是弗里茨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.91,0:01:06.25,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}先丢一盘 再救回两个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:08.55,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.55,0:01:10.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他把自己留在了签表里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.11,0:01:35.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz back from the brink.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯从悬崖边回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:41.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a heartbreaker for Taylor Fritz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N对弗里茨而言 这太遗憾了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.71,0:01:45.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛对鲁德 两个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 这次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.21,0:01:47.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他没有再让比赛走进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:49.94,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第一次站上巴黎决赛场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:02:00.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Well, it's an 11th Masters 1000 level final for Carlos Alcaraz,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯第十一次进大师赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.66,0:02:05.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}his first here in Paris.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在巴黎则是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}美网复出那一站
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:10.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谢尔顿挡住了他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:13.50,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}巴黎再遇 首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:15.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡全部救下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:20.43,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘抢七 {\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.43,0:02:22.68,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿卡从底线寻找进攻机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:24.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后{\fs78}5{\fs68}个小分拿下{\fs78}4{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:26.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:04.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 阿卡先追回{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:05.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}接下来的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.47,0:03:09.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他还要顶住底线相持 争回领先
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:38.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Maybe just over-complicated it at the end, Shelton.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿最后或许处理得复杂了些
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:41.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A magnificent point from both.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N双方打出精彩的一分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.11,0:03:45.78,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘接对手二发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:48.23,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}12{\fs68}个小分里阿卡拿下{\fs78}8{\fs68}个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.23,0:03:49.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}2{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.30,0:03:52.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后{\fs78}6{\fs68}局赢下{\fs78}5{\fs68}局 {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}5{\fs68}领先
