Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:15.92,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz wins the Rolex Paris Masters{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯赢得巴黎大师赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:19.22,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}for the very first time in his career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是他生涯第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.47,0:04:28.88,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他张开双臂 走向球网
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:30.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}差点提前结束的这一周
